<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103307" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτμον</span></b> , and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτετμον</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		aor. without any pres. in use, used by <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> in indic. both with and without
			augm.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overtake,
				reach, find</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθ᾽ ὅ γε Νέστορ᾽ ἔτετμε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.293
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.515
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.256
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃν . . γῆρας ἔτετμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.218
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔνδον ἀμύμονα τέτμεν ἄκοιτιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.374
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.58
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφρ᾽ ἔτι . . μητέρα τέτμῃς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.15
				</span></i>
			; 3pl.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1275
				</span></i>
			; opt. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτμοιμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.61
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>partake of, have allotted one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς δέ κε τέτμῃ ἀταρτηροῖο γενέθλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					610
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
